<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel Q3 net 328 mln guilders.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel Q3 net 328 mln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     328     vs  324</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		   4.61  vs    4.56</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			  nil     vs   nil</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)		  1.50  vs  same</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			    5.49  vs    5.22</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     510     vs  494</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast third quarter net profit of 298-364 million guilders before extraordinary items, with consensus at 336 million guiders.  </p>
<p>    Interest charges				66  vs   64</p>
<p>    Tax						129  vs  124</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
